  (text "Guardian Zone Expander - 32 Channel Supervised Alarm Input Module\n\nHierarchical Sheet Organization:\n- Power: 12V input, reverse protection, buck converter (12V→3.3V)\n- MCU: STM32G0/G4, crystal, SWD, UART debug\n- Ethernet: W5500 SPI controller + MagJack\n- ZoneBank1-4: 8 zones each, EOL resistors, TVS/PTC protection\n- Outputs: Siren driver + 2-4 relays\n- Connectors: Terminal blocks, status LEDs, buttons\n\nTarget: PCBWay 4-layer ENIG, ~5 prototypes\nSee hardware/zone-expander/SYMBOLS.md for detailed symbol list"
    (at 20 40 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left))
    (uuid "doc-text-1")
  )

